{"id":"u-3cc0cb24-8f8a-41cb-9210-6e134a1afc67","src":"community","title":"RPT Blood And Guts 2.0","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/aKu0l9-rpt-blood-and-guts-1","desc":"To get more jacked and stacked then ever before. \nFocus on using high intensity reverse pyramid training. Low volume for max recovery. Push hard and progress every week.\n\nEach set to be progressed individually, 6-8 range is its own progression compared to 8-10  / 10-12 range. Once at the top of rep range, increase weight and aim for low end of range. Aim for 1 rep increase per week. Rep in reserve for each set should be 0-1.\n\nBe sure to warm up, first set is all out.\nRest for 3 min between sets.\n\nExample: \nWeek One: 135 x 7, 120 x 9, 110 x 11\nWeek Two: 135 x 8, 120 x 10, 110 x 12\nWeek Three: 140 x 6, 125 x 8, 115 x 10\n\nSample Split - Monday, Wednesday, Friday. At least one day off between lifting days. Low impact cardio or lots of walking can be done on off days.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":11,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-06T18:22:20.219Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Legs +Abs","Shoulders + Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Kroc Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1}],"note":"Myo Reps - Pause at bottom to 3/4 way up then back down. Complete right after split squat, no rest."},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Single Leg Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":1